<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Fig. 6: </span>Evolution of inter-class similarity on the training set across epochs. Each subplot <math id="S3.F6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(i,j)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math> corresponds to the similarity between class <math id="S3.F6.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> and class <math id="S3.F6.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>, where curves represent different contrastive learning–assisted training strategies. Classes 1 to 6 are ordered from the head class (Sinus rhythm) to the tail classes (Tachycardias).</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S3.F7" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.19315v1/Chen7.png" id="S3.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:429/129;" width="429" height="129" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Fig. 7: </span>Inter-class similarity heatmaps on the test set under different contrastive learning–assisted training strategies. Classes 1 to 6 are ordered from the head class (Sinus rhythm) to the tail classes (Tachycardias).</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S3.F8" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.19315v1/Chen8.png" id="S3.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:238/94;" width="238" height="94" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Fig. 8: </span>Boxplot of intra-class compactness on the test set, measured by cosine similarity between each sample and its class centroid.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S3.F9" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.19315v1/Chen9.png" id="S3.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:191/143;" width="191" height="143" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Fig. 9: </span>PR.Macro Precision–Macro Recall scatter plot of different ablation settings. Each marker represents one configuration with the shorthand notation: S = Single (ECG only), D = Dual (ECG+IEGM), C = concatenation fusion, A = attention fusion in our proposed model, M = MLP head, T = Transformer head in our proposed model, N = no contrastive loss, G = AGCACL.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S3.F10" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.19315v1/Chen10.png" id="S3.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:429/242;" width="429" height="242" alt="Refer to caption">
